  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan seeks it while the white bone wheel in his aperture is near destruction.",
        "chapters": [
          431
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan keeps the Gu under his tongue as a blue lump of fire.",
        "chapters": [
          445
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "repair-burn",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He breathes out eerie blue ghost fire that lands on Bone Bamboo Gu and burns it into white bone smoke for the battle bone wheel’s cracks. The fire feels chilling to the bone as it burns.",
        "chapters": [
          445
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "repair-burn",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_bone_bamboo_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Ghost Fire Gu is a rank two soul path Gu. Once it advances, it becomes rank three ghost flame Gu. Night wolf king ghost fire in that scene comes from rank four ghost blaze Gu, not from Ghost Fire Gu itself.",
        "chapters": [
          457
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ghost-flame-advance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In a later duel Fang Yuan uses a rank one Ghost Fire Gu, then a rank two copy whose ghost fire is double the size, and then a rank three Ghost Fire Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          855
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ghost-flame-advance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Ghost fires can injure the soul.",
        "chapters": [
          855
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ghost-flame-advance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
